translate italian jezs8_d8ae786f:

    # det "No, but Javi keeps asking to get a dog."
    det "No, ma Javi continua a chiedermi di prendere un cane."

# game/Scenes/Jez/JezConversation/jezs8.rpy:18
translate italian jezs8_89e2d1b5:

    # det "I don't think he's mature enough to take care of one quite yet."
    det "Non credo che sia ancora abbastanza maturo per prendersene cura."

# game/Scenes/Jez/JezConversation/jezs8.rpy:20
translate italian jezs8_edd444e9:

    # det "But I'll probably give in one of these days."
    det "Ma probabilmente cederò uno di questi giorni."

# game/Scenes/Jez/JezConversation/jezs8.rpy:21
translate italian jezs8_b5107ad9:

    # det "I do like dogs."
    det "Mi piacciono i cani."

# game/Scenes/Jez/JezConversation/jezs8.rpy:23
translate italian jezs8_2cd218b0:

    # det "I don't really have the time to take care of a pet though."
    det "Però non ho davvero il tempo di occuparmi di un animale domestico."

# game/Scenes/Jez/JezConversation/jezs8.rpy:25
translate italian jezs8_924b6ad9:

    # det "Or the energy."
    det "Né l’energia."

# game/Scenes/Jez/JezConversation/jezs8.rpy:27
translate italian jezs8_406113aa:

    # det "When I come home from work, I want to relax and spend some time with my family."
    det "Quando torno a casa dal lavoro, voglio rilassarmi e passare un po’ di tempo con la mia famiglia."

# game/Scenes/Jez/JezConversation/jezs8.rpy:29
translate italian jezs8_12047b0c:

    # det "Not clean poop and pee out of the carpet."
    det "Non pulire cacca e pipì dal tappeto."

# game/Scenes/Jez/JezConversation/jezs8.rpy:31
translate italian jezs8_19fa98ec:

    # det "And Mamá would not want to deal with that, for sure."
    det "E la mamma non vorrebbe certo occuparsene."

# game/Scenes/Jez/JezConversation/jezs8.rpy:32
translate italian jezs8_f8db6c17:

    # det "She doesn't even like dogs. Wouldn't ever let me have one, growing up."
    det "A lei non piacciono nemmeno i cani. Da piccola non mi avrebbe mai permesso di averne uno."

# game/Scenes/Jez/JezConversation/jezs8.rpy:34
translate italian jezs8_ebf5e8f6:

    # det "But Javi is getting to that age where he wants a pet or a brother or something."
    det "Ma Javi sta arrivando a quell’età in cui vuole un animale domestico, un fratellino o qualcosa del genere."

# game/Scenes/Jez/JezConversation/jezs8.rpy:36
translate italian jezs8_7132ad21:

    # det "And I want him to have something besides playing Minecraft online with his friends."
    det "E io voglio che abbia qualcosa da fare oltre a giocare a Minecraft online con i suoi amici."

# game/Scenes/Jez/JezConversation/jezs8.rpy:38
translate italian jezs8_f8f25e06:

    # det "So yeah, no pets yet, but probably gonna get a dog soon for Javi."
    det "Quindi sì, per ora niente animali domestici, ma probabilmente prenderemo presto un cane per Javi."

# game/Scenes/Jez/JezConversation/jezs8.rpy:40
translate italian jezs8_baf48f07:

    # det "That will be... interesting."
    det "Sarà... interessante."

